OL,3,AFrance gears up for strikes and
OL,4,Aprotests as unions promise national
OL,5,Amobilisation
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of thousands of demonstrators
OL,8,Fare expected to take part in marches
OL,9,Facross France as five unions join
OL,10,Fstrikes and protests in a national day
OL,11,Fof action.
OL,13,FThe protests began in September with
OL,14,Fhigh school students complaining about
OL,15,Fpoor conditions and resources in
OL,16,Feducation, but have spread to include
OL,17,Fthe so-called "yellow-vest" movement
OL,18,Fand workers.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
