OL,3,AFrance gears up for strikes and
OL,4,Aprotests as unions promise national
OL,5,Amobilisation
OL,6,
OL,7,FAuthorities expect 500,000 to 700,000
OL,8,Fdemonstrators to join marches, with
OL,9,Ftens of thousands more in Paris alone,
OL,10,Fin a day billed by one union leader as
OL,11,F"a great day of convergence".
OL,13,FThe five unions have combined forces
OL,14,Facross the public and private sector,
OL,15,Fwith demands for higher wages to combat
OL,16,Fthe cost of living and protected public
OL,17,Fservices.
